    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Start Here'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98000' id='11' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
            <zone h='98000' id='8' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='82400' x='800' y='1000'>
              <zone h='98000' id='6' type-v2='layout-basic' w='82400' x='800' y='1000'>
                <zone h='49000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='82400' x='800' y='1000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run>Explore how phosphate stress reshapes Arabidopsis expression across wild type, pdr2 and l1l2.

Start with the annotation landscape below, then open Response Explorer for expression differences, mutant response patterns and gene-level records.

Reading guide: pathway and family tiles show annotated gene counts. They do not test enrichment or prove pathway activation. Statistical genotype effects require replicate-level count data.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
